    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d937">

                <pb facs="0954" n="866" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg866"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-10-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 11, 1903</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 213.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that four of
                    the mixed commissions for the settlement of claims have closed their
                    sessions—French, Belgian, Mexican, and German. In my No. 212 of to-day I have
                    given you the decision of the Mexican commission. I now inclose you a newspaper
                    clipping with a brief account of the work of the German commission.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William W.
                    Russell.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d937-a1.xml" xpointer="d937-a1"/>
